--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Figure 1 image assets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
figures/asset_chip_in.png, asset_chip_rec.png, asset_strip_full.png, asset_strip_vis.png are
small satellite-image thumbnails embedded in Figure 1. They are derived from Copernicus Sentinel
imagery (source stated by the authors; the scene identifier and date are not recorded in this
repository). Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data. Sentinel data are free and open under
the Copernicus data policy:
https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/documents/247904/690755/Sentinel_Data_Legal_Notice

figures/assets_regen/ holds a reconstruction pair regenerated from the released checkpoint on a
recorded public-domain NAIP item (figures/make_assets.py; provenance in assets_provenance.json).
It is not used in Figure 1.

